{"version":1,"content":"<p>胃口欠佳，胃氣脹？</p><p>註冊中醫師胡玘君表示，醃青蘿蔔有助消食化積，能促進腸胃蠕動，緩解胸悶腹脹，改善港人常見的胃氣脹問題。</p><p>她分享自家醃青蘿蔔的方法。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T01:21:49.867255+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":74,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T00:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T02:38:04.120516+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T01:18:41.371043+00:00","content_hash":"b6717d0cb60bf8c1602738ec0ee1ef079f737968f13a5ada26ba745f5e9c6b43","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}